 PEMDAS.\n\nNotice that $\\left(-3\\right)^{0}=1.$ So, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-3)}^{0}+{2}^{2}÷2 & = \\\\ 1+{2}^{2}÷2 & = \\\\ 1+4÷2 & = \\\\ 1+2 & = \\\\ 3 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130481 #edb/ref 1065 8061 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130481 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "e2d29fa0-8bcb-537b-bed9-91a9ff109764" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130481 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
